{'symbol': 'TSCO', 'date': '2023-02-21 10:10:00', 'title': "TRACTOR SUPPLY NAMED TO FORBES LIST OF AMERICA'S BEST LARGE EMPLOYERS 2023", 'text': "BRENTWOOD, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #4H--TRACTOR SUPPLY COMPANY (NASDAQ: TSCO), THE LARGEST RURAL LIFESTYLE RETAILER IN THE UNITED STATES, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE FORBES LIST OF AMERICA'S BEST LARGE EMPLOYERS. THE COMPANY'S RANKING IMPROVED TO 177 IN THE LATEST YEAR'S REPORT FROM 329 IN 2022."}